WEBVTT

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.507
Last ride at the fair.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.094
Catch the brass ring and you get another turn.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.040
This time, a little closer.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.947
One more ride. All hers.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.409
The next ride is yours.
